From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 16:43:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add real illustrations/icons from client assets (60 files,
 optimized+transparent)

- Welcome: real logo + hero illustration
- Terminal: banner illustration + round badge icon (x4)
- Home: sticker icons for terminal cards + Next Chapter
- Module: per-module banner illustration (30/32 modules)
- VisaStamp: real plane icon in stamp
- Transition: real illustration for 2/4 transitions (rest keep generated SVG)
- VisaQuestion: real illustration for Assetland only
- NextChapter: sticker icons per archetype (6/6, incl. recovered corrupt investor file)
- AvatarPicker: added 3rd option (hijab) + real photos for all 3
- All assets trimmed, resized, and pngquant-compressed (71MB source -> 6.6MB)
